                                "sense_id": "2dcca2a6-61cc-3c84-bce6-5659d14ef0ea",
                                "text": "The original wild varieties of Game fowl are three: the Black-breasted Red, with fawn-breasted partridge hens; the Brown-breasted Reds, with dark legs and dark-brown hens, and the Red-breasted Ginger Reds, with yellow legs, and the hens of a light partridge color."
                            }
                        ]
